{"3918760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maré", "steam_appid": 3918760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An open-world fishing and exploration game with a relaxing atmosphere and light progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish and upgrade your gear</strong><br>Use your rod to catch a variety of fish species. Sell your catch and invest in upgrades for your rod and boat. The better your equipment, the farther you can sail — and the rarer the fish you'll find.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the ocean at your own pace</strong><br>Sail through calm waters, discover new regions, and enjoy the freedom of an open world with no pressure. Each new area brings unique scenery and surprising species.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and rewarding progression</strong><br>With a simple, addictive loop, the game offers a casual experience perfect for players who want to unwind while gradually progressing — fishing, exploring, and upgrading their boat.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/e466bdff9bc98b621ca723ae87287942.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An open-world fishing and exploration game with a relaxing atmosphere and light progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish and upgrade your gear</strong><br>Use your rod to catch a variety of fish species. Sell your catch and invest in upgrades for your rod and boat. The better your equipment, the farther you can sail — and the rarer the fish you'll find.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/d0339e2e1dda52bbb86eabfa9ba5a578.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the ocean at your own pace</strong><br>Sail through calm waters, discover new regions, and enjoy the freedom of an open world with no pressure. Each new area brings unique scenery and surprising species.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.poster.avif?t=1786318867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.webm?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918760/extras/6fdddbc64aaffa04ab18629cb0eed0da.mp4?t=1786318867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and rewarding progression</strong><br>With a simple, addictive loop, the game offers a casual experience perfect for players who want to unwind while gradually progressing — fishing, exploring, and upgrading their boat.</p>", "short_description": "In a relaxing open world, fish and explore at your own pace. Sell the fish you catch, invest in upgrades for your boat, and discover new areas with more valuable species. The farther you go, the more surprises the ocean reveals.",